14. Common failure modes & fixes
Symptom	Likely cause	Fix
Invalid API key after ~1 hour	No refresh before Admin API use	Call ensureFreshAccessToken in API factory / jobs
Refresh works in admin but jobs fail	Jobs use serialized/stale token, never refresh	Refresh at job handle() start
Refresh suddenly invalid for shop	Concurrent double-refresh	Add per-shop cache lock; re-check after lock
env() null in production	config:cache	Move credentials to config; use config()
Middleware never runs	Auth middleware commented out on API routes	Wrap admin routes in shopify.auth
No refresh_token in DB	Token acquired without expiring=1	Re-acquire with expiring=1 (exchange/OAuth)
Works until ~90 days then dies forever in background	Refresh token expired	Merchant must reopen app for exchange/OAuth
HMAC / OAuth callback 401	Wrong API secret / config cache	Verify Partner app secret + config bootstrap
