18. Summary (one paragraph)
Shopify now issues offline Admin API tokens that expire about every hour and include a refresh token (~90 days). This project stores both values, requests them with expiring=1 during OAuth/token exchange, and centrally refreshes via TokenExchange::ensureFreshAccessToken() before Admin API usage in middleware, getShop/getShopApi, jobs, webhooks, and direct GraphQL clients. Without that ensure-fresh step on every path, API calls eventually fail with “Invalid API key or access token”.

